#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/gemm_op/index.rst:29
msgid ""
"This is the default synchronous GEMM interface. On Hopper, if the compiler "
"selects WGMMA lowering, TileLang inserts the corresponding wait implicitly. "
"On Blackwell TCGEN5MMA, TileLang inserts the corresponding "
"`mbarrier_wait_parity(...)` implicitly after issue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/gemm_op/index.rst:34
msgid ""
"For manual asynchronous scheduling, use `T.wgmma_gemm(...)` with `T."
"wait_wgmma(...)` on Hopper, or `T.tcgen05_gemm(...)` with `T."
"mbarrier_wait_parity(...)` on Blackwell."
msgstr ""

