#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/gemm_op/index.rst:66
msgid ""
"This is the explicit asynchronous Hopper WGMMA counterpart to the default "
"synchronous `T.gemm(...)` interface, with two stricter guarantees: - it "
"always requests the WGMMA lowering path - it never auto-emits an inlined "
"`warpgroup_wait`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/gemm_op/index.rst:71
msgid ""
"If the current target or operand pattern cannot use Hopper WGMMA, "
"compilation fails instead of silently falling back to MMA."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/gemm_op/index.rst:79
msgid ""
"This is the explicit asynchronous Blackwell TCGEN5MMA counterpart to the "
"default synchronous `T.gemm(...)` interface, with two stricter guarantees: - "
"it always requests the TCGEN5MMA lowering path - it never auto-emits an "
"inlined `mbarrier_wait_parity`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/gemm_op/index.rst:84
msgid ""
"When ``use_2cta=True``, the instruction is lowered to the 2CTA variant which "
"requires ``cluster_dims`` to be ``(2,1,1)`` or ``(1,2,1)``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/gemm_op/index.rst:87
msgid ""
"If the current target or operand pattern cannot use Blackwell TCGEN5MMA, "
"compilation fails instead of silently falling back to another GEMM path."
msgstr ""
